# STOCKHOLM 1.0

#=GF AC   RF00025
#=GF ID   Telomerase-cil
#=GF DE   Ciliate telomerase RNA
#=GF AU   Griffiths-Jones SR; 0000-0001-6043-807X
#=GF AU   Moxon SJ; 0000-0003-4644-1816
#=GF AU   Ontiveros-Palacios N; 0000-0001-8457-4455
#=GF SE   McCormick-Graham and Romero, PMID:7739888; Griffiths-Jones SR, Moxon SJ
#=GF SS   Published; PMID:7958872; PMID:7739888, Moxon SJ
#=GF GA   52.00
#=GF TC   52.20
#=GF NC   42.20
#=GF TP   Gene;
#=GF BM   cmbuild -F CM SEED
#=GF CB   cmcalibrate --mpi CM
#=GF SM   cmsearch --cpu 4 --verbose --nohmmonly -T 30.00 -Z 742849.287494 CM SEQDB
#=GF CL   CL00004
#=GF DR   SO; 0000390; telomerase_RNA;
#=GF DR   GO; 0007004; telomere maintenance via telomerase;
#=GF DR   GO; 0003720; telomerase activity;
#=GF DR   GO; 0000333; telomerase catalytic core complex;
#=GF RN   [1]
#=GF RM   7739888
#=GF RT   Ciliate telomerase RNA structural features.
#=GF RA   McCormick-Graham M, Romero DP
#=GF RL   Nucleic Acids Res 1995;23:1091-1097.
#=GF RN   [2]
#=GF RM   7958872
#=GF RT   Telomerase RNAs of different ciliates have a common secondary structure
#=GF RT   and a permuted template.
#=GF RA   Lingner J, Hendrick LL, Cech TR
#=GF RL   Genes Dev 1994;8:1984-1998.
#=GF RN   [3]
#=GF RM   29775593
#=GF RT   Structure of Telomerase with Telomeric DNA.
#=GF RA   Jiang J, Wang Y, Susac L, Chan H, Basu R, Zhou ZH, Feigon J
#=GF RL   Cell. 2018;173:1179-1190.
#=GF RN   [4]
#=GF RM   33981033
#=GF RT   Structures of telomerase at several steps of telomere repeat synthesis.
#=GF RA   He Y, Wang Y, Liu B, Helmling C, Susac L, Cheng R, Zhou ZH, Feigon J
#=GF RL   Nature. 2021;593:454-459.
#=GF CC   Telomerase is a ribonucleoprotein reverse transcriptase that synthesises
#=GF CC   telomeric DNA. Telomerase RNAs differ greatly in sequence and structure
#=GF CC   between vertebrates, ciliates and yeasts, but they share a 5' pseudoknot
#=GF CC   structure close to the template sequence [1,2]. The structure of
#=GF CC   Tetrahymena telomerase has been reported in 6D6V, 7LMA and 7LMB [3,4].
#=GF WK   Telomerase_RNA_component
#=GF SQ   21


