#=GF RT   Pseudoknot and translational control in the expression of the S15
#=GF RT   ribosomal protein.
#=GF RA   Benard L, Philippe C, Ehresmann B, Ehresmann C, Portier C
#=GF RL   Biochimie 1996;78:568-576.
#=GF CC   The E. coli Ribosomal S15 gene 5' UTR can form two alternative structures.
#=GF CC   One that is a series of three hairpins, The other includes a pseudoknot.
#=GF CC   This structure causes translational regulation of the S15 protein. The
#=GF CC   alignment of this family contains only the final two hairpins which are
#=GF CC   conserved in other species, and also includes the complete region that
#=GF CC   forms the alternate structures.
#=GF WK   Ribosomal_S15_leader
#=GF SQ   78


