#=GF RT   Frequent deletions and down-regulation of micro- RNA genes miR15 and miR16
#=GF RT   at 13q14 in chronic lymphocytic leukemia.
#=GF RA   Calin GA, Dumitru CD, Shimizu M, Bichi R, Zupo S, Noch E, Aldler H, Rattan
