#=GF CC   This family represents a ribosomal frameshifting element found in the mRNA
#=GF CC   of the dnaX gene in E. coli. The dnaX gene has two encoded products tau
#=GF CC   and gamma which are produced in a 1:1 ratio. The gamma protein is
#=GF CC   synthesised due to programmed frameshifting and is shorter than tau. The
#=GF CC   two products of the dnaX gene are DNA polymerase III subunits [1,2].
#=GF WK   DnaX_ribosomal_frameshifting_element
#=GF SQ   5


