#=GF DR   GO; 0005691; U6atac snRNP;
#=GF RN   [1]
#=GF RM   15987817
#=GF RT   Evolutionary conservation of minor U12-type spliceosome between plants and
#=GF RT   humans.
#=GF RA   Lorkovic ZJ, Lehner R, Forstner C, Barta A
