#=GF CC   RNAs can be post-transcriptional modified, in micro RNAs (miRNA) editing
#=GF CC   of pre-mRNA is a common process. The structure of the mir-2985 has been
#=GF CC   reported in complex with ADAR protein [3] where they call it R/G site, in
#=GF CC   the structure, reported in PDB 2L3J, R/G site is reported as a regular
#=GF CC   A-form helix structure, composed of a stem-loop containing three base-pair
#=GF CC   mismatches, 2 C:A and 1 G:G. Based on the sequences presented in the SEED
#=GF CC   alignment, one of the C:A mismatches reported in [3] was updated to a a:u
#=GF CC   base pair. This family represents the microRNA (miRNA) precursor mir-2985
#=GF CC   imported from miRBase [4].
